ts</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">瓦卡维尔市中心的五星理发店。剪得干净、聊得开心，理发师对小朋友也特别好。</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Final+Kuts+Barbershop/@38.3559069,-121.9891209,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d0d426bd07d:0x6bc0dff565469c5b!8m2!3d38.3559069!4d-121.9891209!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>5.0 · Google 上的 227 条评价<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/384088_final-kuts_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2v2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2V2h-2v2H9V2H7zm-2 8h14v10H5V10z\"/></svg> 在 Booksy 预约</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Final%20Kuts%2C%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%2C%20Vacaville%2C%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> 导航</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Final+Kuts+Barbershop/@38.3559069,-121.9891209,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d0d426bd07d:0x6bc0dff565469c5b!8m2!3d38.3559069!4d-121.9891209!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">227 条评价，5.0★</a></li><li>欢迎直接到店</li><li>在 Booksy 预约理发师</li><li>儿童理发</li><li>可预约营业时间外理发</li><li>市中心 Merchant St</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">关于本店</p><h2>Merchant Street 上的好氛围。</h2><p>Final Kuts 是瓦卡维尔市中心的理发店，200 多条评价平均 5.0 分。我们讲究的是热闹的氛围、愉快的聊天，以及不赶时间的理发师。</p><p>欢迎带孩子来。从第一次理发到清爽的渐变，我们的理发师对小朋友都很有耐心。直接到店，或选好理发师在 Booksy 上预约时间。</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Final+Kuts+Barbershop/@38.3559069,-121.9891209,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d0d426bd07d:0x6bc0dff565469c5b!8m2!3d38.3559069!4d-121.9891209!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>5.0★</b><span>227 条评价</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>4</b><span>可预约理发师</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>营业时间外</b><span>可理发</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/booksy-cover.jpg\" alt=\"Final Kuts 标志\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">理发椅上</p><h2>剪发与服务</h2><p>我们每位理发师都有自己的价目单。以下是我们提供的服务，以及各理发师之间的价格区间。</p></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>理发</h3><span class=\"price\">$40–$45+</span></div><p>渐变、修边、侧背头。部分理发师含胡须护理。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>理发＋胡须</h3><span class=\"price\">$45–$50</span></div><p>理发并修整胡须线条，或特色发型含胡须。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>儿童理发</h3><span class=\"price\">$35–$50</span></div><p>儿童基础及特色发型。年龄和日期因理发师而异。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>勾线／胡须</h3><span class=\"price\">$25–$30</span></div><p>全面勾线或只修胡须。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>剃刀剃须＋热毛巾</h3><span class=\"price\">$65+</span></div><p>完整剃刀剃须，或“The final kut”套餐：理发、剃刀修面加热毛巾。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">06</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>女士理发</h3><span class=\"price\">$45</span></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">07</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>白发遮盖染色</h3><span class=\"price\">$50</span></div><p>染发遮盖白发。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">08</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>洗发及护发</h3><span class=\"price\">$30+</span></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">09</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Big chop（剪去烫染部分）</h3><span class=\"price\">$60+</span></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">10</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>营业时间前后</h3><span class=\"price\">$70+</span></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">11</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>月度会员</h3><span class=\"price\">$200</span></div><p>每周理发含胡须、固定预约、热毛巾按摩。</p></article></div><p class=\"note\">价格因理发师而异，并可能调整。点击下方理发师查看完整价目单。</p></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"team\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">团队</p><h2>选择你的理发师</h2><p>选好理发师，在线预约。</p></div><div class=\"team\"><article class=\"member\"><div class=\"member-head\"><div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">H</div><div><h3>Hollywood The Barber</h3><p>Paul Pratt · 理发师</p></div></div><p class=\"member-rating\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span> 5.0 · 307 条评价</p><div class=\"member-links\"><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/196333_hollywood-the-barber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">预约 Hollywood →</a></div><details class=\"member-svc\"><summary>服务与价格</summary><ul><li><span>男士普通理发，不含胡须</span><b>$45</b></li><li><span>男士理发＋胡须勾线</span><b>$45+</b></li><li><span>男士特色发型含胡须</span><b>$50</b></li><li><span>男士特色发型，不含胡须</span><b>$45+</b></li><li><span>The final kut：理发、剃刀修面、热毛巾</span><b>$65+</b></li><li><span>儿童特色发型</span><b>$50</b></li><li><span>7–12 岁儿童基础理发</span><b>$40+</b></li><li><span>6 岁以下儿童（周四/五/六除外）</span><b>$40</b></li><li><span>女士理发</span><b>$45</b></li><li><span>白发遮盖染色</span><b>$50</b></li><li><span>洗发及护发</span><b>$30+</b></li><li><span>Big chop（剪去烫染部分）</span><b>$60+</b></li><li><span>营业时间外理发</span><b>$70+</b></li></ul></details></article><article class=\"member\"><div class=\"member-head\"><div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">P</div><div><h3>Patrick</h3><p>理发师</p></div></div><p class=\"member-rating\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span> 4.9 · 58 条评价</p><p class=\"member-bio\">我叫 Patrick，是瓦卡维尔的理发师。我擅长渐变、修边、侧背头、胡须和剃刀剃须。</p><div class=\"member-links\"><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/593397_patrick_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">预约 Patrick →</a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/peezysofaded/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Patrick on Instagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zm5.5-3a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3z\"/></svg> @peezysofaded</a></div><details class=\"member-svc\"><summary>服务与价格</summary><ul><li><span>完整理发</span><b>$45</b></li><li><span>儿童理发</span><b>$35</b></li><li><span>全面勾线</span><b>$30</b></li><li><span>完整剃刀剃须</span><b>$65</b></li><li><span>营业时间前后</span><b>$70</b></li><li><span>月度会员<small>每周理发含胡须、固定预约、热毛巾按摩</small></span><b>$200</b></li></ul></details></article><article class=\"member\"><div class=\"member-head\"><div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">M</div><div><h3>Marethebarber</h3><p>Amare Crawford · 理发师</p></div></div><p class=\"member-rating\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span> 4.7 · 25 条评价</p><div class=\"member-links\"><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1366045_marethebarber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">预约 Mare →</a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/maretthebarber/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Marethebarber on Instagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zm5.5-3a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3z\"/></svg> @maretthebarber</a></div><details class=\"member-svc\"><summary>服务与价格</summary><ul><li><span>完整理发（含胡须）</span><b>$45</b></li><li><span>儿童理发（8 岁及以上）</span><b>$35</b></li><li><span>勾线</span><b>$30</b></li><li><span>特色发型</span><b>$50</b></li></ul></details></article><article class=\"member\"><div class=\"member-head\"><div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">L</div><div><h3>Luis</h3><p>Luis Morales · 理发师</p></div></div><p class=\"member-rating\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span> 5.0 · 11 条评价</p><div class=\"member-links\"><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1711890_luis_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">预约 Luis →</a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/svt.fadez/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Luis on Instagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zm5.5-3a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3z\"/></svg> @svt.fadez</a></div><details class=\"member-svc\"><summary>服务与价格</summary><ul><li><span>理发</span><b>$40</b></li><li><span>胡须</span><b>$25</b></li><li><span>理发＋胡须</span><b>$45</b></li><li><span>儿童理发</span><b>$35</b></li></ul></details></article></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">温馨提示</p><h2>设施与须知</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>欢迎直接到店</b></li><li><b>在线预约</b><span>每位理发师都接受在线预约</span></li><li><b>儿童理发</b><span>Hollywood 的 6 岁以下儿童理发周四至周六不提供</span></li><li><b>接受信用卡</b><span>Patrick 收卡；其他理发师请来电确认</span></li><li><b>停车位</b></li><li><b>无障碍设施</b></li><li><b>Wi-Fi</b></li><li><b>营业时间外预约</b><span>Hollywood 和 Patrick 提供（$70 起）</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">相册</p><h2>店里的作品</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/taper.jpg\" alt=\"渐变修边，侧面\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/design-cut.jpg\" alt=\"自由造型发型设计\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/skin-fade.jpg\" alt=\"贴头皮渐变配清晰分线\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/beard-lineup.jpg\" alt=\"店内胡须勾线\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/afro-cut.jpg\" alt=\"造型爆炸头配勾线\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fade-side.jpg\" alt=\"低位渐变，侧面\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fade-pair.jpg\" alt=\"两款刚剪好的渐变\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/chair.jpg\" alt=\"Final Kuts 的理发椅\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">评价</p><h2>顾客怎么说</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">5.0</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 227 条评价</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Final+Kuts+Barbershop/@38.3559069,-121.9891209,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d0d426bd07d:0x6bc0dff565469c5b!8m2!3d38.3559069!4d-121.9891209!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">在 Google 上查看更多评价 →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Booksy</b> · 401 条评价</div><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/384088_final-kuts_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">在 Booksy 上查看更多评价 →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Best spot in town, hands down. No matter who you get, they&#39;re all great &amp; always take care of everyone that walks through the door. The atmosphere is lively &amp; the conversations are entertaining. I highly recommend everyone to check out Final Kuts.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Paul is professional, reliable and his shop is pleasant and very clean. He does an excellent job on my hair!!!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Andrea · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/196333_hollywood-the-barber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“My son doesn’t like getting haircuts and Patrick was very patient and understanding. The shop is clean and always good vibes when we visit.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Feb 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great experience. My third time going in for a cut with Mare. Friendly, professional and attentive. I am very happy with the cut. Everyone in the shop is very friendly. Great place for a cut and shave. I recommend.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Rick · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1366045_marethebarber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Amare took our walk-in for my 1year old son’s mullet haircut and not only perfected exactly what I wanted, but also did it in a timely manner which is critically important when cutting a child’s hair! I’m very pleased! I think I’ve found my son’s barber!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great service Luis is an exceptional barber who pays attention to detail. I left feeling confident highly recommend”</blockquote><figcaption>— Peezy · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1711890_luis_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Andrew is an exceptional barber! He listened to what we needed and cut my son&#39;s hair perfectly- crisp and clean. The barbershop is friendly, comfortable professional and close to places to have a bite while you wait for someone.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Patrick is excellent! Super friendly and chill environment”</blockquote><figcaption>— Vincent · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/593397_patrick_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Sep 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“This is a great barber shop, friendly professional and great cuts. Great for walk ins..”</blockquote><figcaption>— Johnny C. · Yelp</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great atmosphere. My son got a regular hair cut from Paul. He was very attentive, asking questions to ensure he got what he wanted.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Arminthia S. · Yelp</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">常见问题</p><h2>常见问题解答</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>可以直接到店吗？</summary><p>可以！欢迎直接到店，我们甚至给 1 岁的小朋友现场理过发。不想等的话，就在线预约你的理发师。</p></details><details><summary>怎么预约指定的理发师？</summary><p>我们每个人都有自己的预约页面：Hollywood The Barber、Patrick、Marethebarber 和 Luis。点上方的预约按钮就行。</p></details><details><summary>理发多少钱？</summary><p>男士标准理发 $40–$45，视理发师而定。点你理发师的预约按钮查看最新价格。</p></details><details><summary>给小孩理发吗？</summary><p>理！儿童理发 $35–$50。Mare 接 8 岁及以上的孩子，Hollywood 的 6 岁以下儿童理发周四至周六不提供。</p></details><details><summary>营业时间外能理发吗？</summary><p>可以。Hollywood 提供营业时间外理发，$70 起；Patrick 提供营业前后理发，$70。</p></details><details><summary>收卡吗？</summary><p>Patrick 收信用卡。其他理发师请致电 (707) 685-9136 确认。</p></details><details><summary>营业时间是什么时候？</summary><p>周一上午 10 点至下午 6 点，周二至周五上午 10 点至晚上 7 点，周六上午 9 点至下午 6 点，周日休息。营业时间可能略有变动，请在线预约或来电。</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">欢迎光临</p>\n      <h2>营业时间和地址</h2>\n      <address>348 Merchant St Ste A<br>Vacaville, CA 95688</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17076859136\">(707) 685-9136</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>星期一</td><td>10 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>星期二</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>星期三</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>星期四</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>星期五</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>星期六</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>星期日</td><td>休息</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">营业时间可能略有变动，请在线预约或来电确认。</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/final_kuts/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 